EE8D  7EE57C                          jmp cmdline
EE90  3001            xss             leax 1,x             ;XSSaddr,len command.
EE92  9D15                            jsr xopenout         ;Send Srecords through XMODEM
EE94  7EEAF3                          jmp sendrec             
