F9A2  B302CD                          subd dpsetting  
F9A5  4D                              tsta            ;Can we use 8-bit operand?
F9A6  2603                            bne opsz2
F9A8  4C                              inca            
F9A9  2002                            bra opsz1
F9AB  8602            opsz2           lda #2
